	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - M1421\n\nPADS FOR M1421 - PART TBC (see docs/open-questions.md Q1).\nPlaceholder interface: VCC, VIO, GND, JTAG (TCK, TMS, TDI, TDO, nTRST, nSRST), debug UART TX/RX, RESET, BOOT.\nJTAG + UART -> buffers -> FT4232H ch A/B (sheet USB Dev).\nData link to P4 TBC (UART/SPI). Supply M1421 rail (switched, PM3 ch2).\n10-pin Cortex/ARM or 2x7 JTAG header footprint as DNP fallback."
